# Supporting English Learners through Technology: What Districts and Teachers Say about Digital Learning Resources for English Learners. Volume II: Technical Appendices

**Authors:** Zehler, Annette M., Miyaoka, Atsushi, Chaney, Brad, Orellana, Valerie, Vahey, Philip, Gibney, Daniela Torre, Yee, Kaily, Yilmazel-Sahin, Yesim

## Abstract
This is the technical appendices for the report, &quot;Supporting English Learners through Technology: What Districts and Teachers Say about Digital Learning Resources for English Learners.&quot; Five appendices are included. The appendices are: (1) Methodology; (2) District Context and Teacher Background; (3) Supplemental Exhibits; (4) Data Collection Instruments; and (5) Digital Learning Resource Matrix and Digital Support Features Matrix. [For the full report, see ED600461.]

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED600462

